OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters say watercourses are
OL,4,A'choked' with weed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoaters and anglers have gathered in
OL,7,FLincoln to object to the condition of
OL,8,Ftwo waterways.
OL,10,FMembers of Burton Waters Boat Club,
OL,11,Fwhich organised the gathering at the
OL,12,FBrayford Pool on Saturday, say the Foss
OL,13,FDyke and the River Witham are choked
OL,14,Fwith weed and are overgrown.
OL,16,FThe club's Lee Bonham said they paid
OL,17,F"significant" licence fees to the Canal
OL,18,F& River Trust but saw little
OL,19,Fmaintenance in return.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
