OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters say watercourses are
OL,4,A'choked' with weed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust, which is responsible for
OL,7,Fmaintaining the waterways, said it was
OL,8,Ftaking action to cut back vegetation
OL,9,Fbut stressed that the warmer climate
OL,10,Fwas providing ideal growing conditions
OL,11,Ffor fast-growing weed.
